# Reptilian Recruiter: "When this creature enters, choose target creature. If that creature's power is 2 or less or if you control another Lizard, gain control of that creature until
# end of turn, untap it, and it gains haste until end of turn." Bot2's Grizzly Bears (power 2, exactly at the limit), tapped from attacking, are taken with no other Lizard: they untap,
# attack with haste for 2 (Bot2 20 -> 18) and are Bot2's again on its next turn (CR 611.2a, 613.1b). The Recruiter is a Lizard but not "another" one, and it has trample (CR 702.19).

